{
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:0": "好無聊喔",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "往那邊看……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:10": "咦～？怎麼突然變陰天了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:11": "好過分喔！氣象預報明明\n沒說會下雨的，討厭啦……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:2": "往這邊看……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:3": "都是一成不變的風景。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:4": "以前追著索尼克跑的時候\n真的好開心喔……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:5": "每天都超刺激的。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:6": "該說是熱血沸騰的冒險日子嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:7": "可是那傢伙，不知不覺間\n就從我面前消失了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/01 Intro (1)/Japanese.txt:8": "唉～有沒有什麼\n讓人心跳加速、興奮期待的事啊～",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:0": "蛋頭博士！？\n糟、糟糕了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:10": "你是從蛋頭博士那裡\n逃出來的吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:11": "好～放心吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:12": "只要有我在，\n絕不會讓他們碰你一根寒毛！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:2": "呀啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:3": "喂，幹嘛啦，\n突然撞過來……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:4": "哎呀，你受傷了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:5": "咦？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:7": "到底是怎樣啦～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/02 Intro (2)/Japanese.txt:9": "那是蛋頭博士的機器人……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/03 Meeting Sonic/Japanese.txt:0": "是索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/03 Meeting Sonic/Japanese.txt:1": "耶～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/03 Meeting Sonic/Japanese.txt:10": "真拿妳沒辦法。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/03 Meeting Sonic/Japanese.txt:11": "啊，好過分喔！\n等等我嘛！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/03 Meeting Sonic/Japanese.txt:5": "等一下！\n你那是什麼態度啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/03 Meeting Sonic/Japanese.txt:6": "吶，這隻小鳥被人追著跑耶。\n你就當一下下保鑣嘛！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/04 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:0": "等一下啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/04 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:1": "真是的，索尼克\n跑得也太快了啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/04 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:10": "真是的，拿妳沒辦法！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/04 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:4": "呀～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/04 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:9": "艾咪！等一下啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/05 After Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:0": "好像總算甩掉\n蛋頭博士的機器人了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/05 After Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:1": "可是跟索尼克走散了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/05 After Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:2": "呀啊啊啊啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/05 After Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:3": "討厭，住手啦！\n放我下來！快放我下來啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/06 Kidnapped/Japanese.txt:0": "啊啊～索尼克～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:1": "什、什麼……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:10": "你不知道……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:11": "不過他們一定\n不會好好對待牠的。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:12": "吶，拜託你！救救牠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:13": "只要你有一點點\n覺得這孩子很可憐的話！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:14": "無法理解。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:15": "為何能為了無關者，\n如此拚命？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:16": "無法理解……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:17": "這樣啊……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:18": "蛋頭博士不會教你\n這種事情吧……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:19": "怎、怎麼了，小鳥？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:2": "小鳥……交出來。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:20": "快逃……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:21": "咦？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:22": "為什麼？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:23": "此處危險……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:24": "快。即將抵達\n神祕遺跡的基地。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:25": "你……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:26": "你好像跟蛋頭博士的\n其他機器不一樣……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:27": "如果你其實\n不是壞人的話……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:28": "下次見面，我們就是朋友囉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:3": "不要……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:4": "乖乖地\n把小鳥交出來。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:5": "不要就是不要！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:6": "為何？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:7": "這還用問為什麼嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:8": "那我問你，\n你們打算拿這孩子怎麼樣？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/07 Prison/Japanese.txt:9": "無相關情報。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/08 Let's see if you can clear this awesome game!/Japanese.txt:0": "呼呵呵呵呵。\n想逃跑？太天真、太天真了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/08 Let's see if you can clear this awesome game!/Japanese.txt:1": "看妳能不能破得了\n這個拷問遊戲！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/09 I can't believe this is happening!/Japanese.txt:0": "唔嘎～！？怎麼可能～！！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/10 Behold the Warrior Feather/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「戰士之羽」。\n可以使出旋轉槌攻擊喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/10 Behold the Warrior Feather/Japanese.txt:1": "按住動作鈕的同時，\n把方向鍵",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/10 Behold the Warrior Feather/Japanese.txt:2": "轉個一圈又一圈試試看！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/11 Tikal Flashback (1)/Japanese.txt:0": "咦、咦？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/11 Tikal Flashback (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "討厭啦！！\n這、這裡是哪裡？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/12 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:0": "這就是……巧歐……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/12 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:1": "……沒事的。\n不用怕喔？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/13 After Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:0": "什、什麼？怎麼了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/13 After Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:1": "剛才……是在做夢嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/13 After Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:2": "啊，糟糕！\n得趕快離開這裡才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/14 Before Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:0": "妳要上哪去啊，艾咪？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/14 Before Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:15": "住手，機器人先生！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/14 Before Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:2": "妳以為逃得掉嗎！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:0": "住手！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:1": "艾咪！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:13": "索尼克嘴上說歸說，\n最後還是會來找我嘛！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:14": "吶，你還好嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:15": "這裡好像已經很危險了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:16": "你也別再聽蛋頭博士的話了，\n快點逃吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:17": "……為何……為何……要救我……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:18": "我不是說過，\n下次見面就是朋友了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:19": "這孩子也\n這麼擔心你呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:2": "那可是蛋頭博士的機器耶！\n……快讓開！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:20": "你絕對不可以再待在\n蛋頭博士身邊了喔！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:21": "艾咪，走囉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:22": "……機器人先生，\n我們一定會再見面的吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:3": "不要！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:4": "這位機器人先生\n放我們逃走了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:5": "他不是壞人喔？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:6": "所以索尼克！……住手！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:8": "知道了啦……\n看來好像有什麼隱情。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/15 After Sonic vs. Gamma/Japanese.txt:9": "吶，索尼克！\n這艘船的高度一直在往下掉耶！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克不知道有沒有事……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:1": "我老是\n被索尼克救。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:10": "我來幫你找到你的家人！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:11": "都已經走到這一步了，\n不管什麼我都會做到！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:12": "我記得那位機器人先生說過，\n神祕遺跡那裡有基地。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:13": "我們去神祕遺跡\n看看吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:2": "這樣下去不行啊。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:3": "不過嚇了我一跳，\n原來你身上帶著混沌翡翠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:4": "難怪會被追得\n那麼緊不放嘛。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:5": "咦？這個墜子……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:6": "……是你的兄弟姊妹？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:7": "你的兄弟姊妹\n還被蛋頭博士抓著嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/16 After Tails leaves/Japanese.txt:9": "好，我知道了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/17 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:0": "這、這裡以前有這座橋嗎……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/17 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:1": "怎麼看都覺得很可疑……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/17 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:3": "……去看看吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/18 Final Egg - ZERO Appears/Japanese.txt:0": "你很煩耶～～～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/19 After Final Egg/Japanese.txt:0": "呼、呼……啊～好險。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/19 After Final Egg/Japanese.txt:1": "結果小鳥的兄弟姊妹\n好像都不在這裡……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/19 After Final Egg/Japanese.txt:2": "小鳥既然是從蛋頭母艦\n逃出來的……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/19 After Final Egg/Japanese.txt:3": "說不定牠們還在\n蛋頭母艦裡面……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/19 After Final Egg/Japanese.txt:4": "……值得去看看！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/20 Before ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "找到了～～～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/20 Before ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "你還好嗎？振作一點！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/20 Before ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "怎麼可以……你怎麼可以這樣！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/20 Before ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "我絕對不原諒你！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "你還好嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "飛得起來嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "太好了……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "這樣你們兄弟姊妹\n又能一起生活了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "太好了呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "……我也要加油才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "艾咪要做\n自己做得到的事！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "總有一天，\n我一定要讓那傢伙回頭看我！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/21 After ZERO Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "到時候才來追我，\n可就太遲了喔～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/22 Here's the Long Hammer/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「長柄槌」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Amy/22 Here's the Long Hammer/Japanese.txt:1": "可以擴大槌子的攻擊範圍。\n旋轉時使用效果超強喔！"
}